        <description>Extract the Closing Stock / Inventory value as at the balance sheet date.

This field may appear under any of these labels:
- Closing Stock, Inventory, Stock in Trade
- Closing Stock (RM), Raw Material Stock, Finished Goods Stock
- Work in Progress, WIP, Work in Process
- Stock-in-trade
- Stone chips / Admixture / Cement / Sand closing values (SUM all if broken by material)

Rules:
- Use CLOSING balance (year end), not opening stock
- If inventory is broken by category (RM, WIP, FG), SUM all categories
- This should appear on the ASSETS side of the Balance Sheet
- Return plain number only. If not found, return: NA</description>
